  "description": "Motocross-style Bike for Kids\n\nThe KEANO 16 Inch Kids' Bike comes with a noise maker, a water bottle, an Number Plate, and fenders. They turn each ride into a wonderful journey, making it highly appealing to young kids at first sight\n\nEnjoy a safer ride!\n\nThis bike has a rear coaster/foot brake for good stopping power. Wide 2.125\" pneumatic tires add stability. It also includes a strong steel frame, an enclosed chainguard, and reflectors on the front, rear, and wheels\n\nPerfect Bike for Beginners\n\nTraining wheels are included for beginners who are still learning to ride. A motocross saddle seat that adds some extra style to this riding machine. With only one speed, there are no complicated gears.\n\nEasy to Assemble\n\nGet riding quickly! The children's bike arrives 85% pre-assembled with basic assembly tools included. A novice can typically complete assembly in about 20 minutes. Plus, it's backed by our limited lifetime warranty\n\nBest Gift for Kids\n\nThis 16-inch kids' bike is the perfect gift for children aged 4-7 years old. It's a fantastic way for any young rider who wants that Motocross feel",
